  | Info           | `bg-cyan-500`                    |
  | Dark           | `bg-slate-800`                   |

  **Reach for this first.** Every token below is defined once in `src/app/globals.css` and switches automatically between light and dark — using it is always correct over a hardcoded hex, in either mode:

  | Token                | Class (`bg-` / `text-` / `border-`) | Light     | Dark      |
  | :------------------- | :---------------------------------- | :-------- | :-------- |
