   **Fix:** Changed to `bg-card`

### Off-checklist fixes (Pass 4)
Found by judgment, not by a numbered check. Empty is a valid result and is still shown.

| Iter | Where | Change | Why |
| :--- | :---- | :----- | :-- |
| 1 | `chartConfig`, L118 | removed the unused `color` key | nothing read it — the `<Area>` sets its own `stroke`, so the config was dead |
| 2 | testimonial data, L41 | `likes` → `rating` | the field drives a 5-star display; `likes` described neither the values nor the UI |

